      Handout contains drawings of five graphs.
    </p>
  </li>

  <li>
    <p>
      Find a hamiltonian cycle or explain why there isn't one.
      <ul>
        <li>
          <p>
            Don't spend too much time on any one graph.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </p>
  </li>
</ol>
      </p>
    </statement>
    
  </activity>
